The eight original proposals jointly forecast 9,475 new singleton cells, zero reopenings and zero formal contradictions across 9,756 scoped definitions. This includes parents with known scope challenges and is **not** an admissible release delta. Child TOUCH scopes overlap their parent. The 1,453-definition human child spans 860 native sense groups and likewise has no formal contradiction. Unknown targets do not independently confirm any proposed rule.

The human parent includes `doctor_of_the_church.n.01`, whose gloss denotes a title conferred on saints. Its source taxonomy alone does not settle the own-denotation boundary. The child adds a positive explicit-person head condition rather than creating a hand-picked exception list. Definitions outside that child remain unchanged, with no opposing zero inferred. This is an actual population refinement, pending independent semantic audits and replay.

The separate earlier I/YOU physical non-person stage supplies another 50,526 provisional zeros. It remains unadmitted, with six explicitly recorded receipt-context reopenings. Its reach must not be counted as installed progress.

## Continuation within the same workflow

1. Preserve the frozen 022 run and its existing validation/publication observer. Rebase later proposals onto the actually published successor.
2. Include foundational and high-use sense questions in the next curriculum alongside population mechanisms. The 44 open mapped prime coordinates and noun-only contextual grounding are concrete readiness obligations.
3. Use legacy patterns, currently unknown consequents and grounded proof chains as proposal sources. Rank their **marginal** unresolved reach; skip already-supported duplicate proposals. Recompute after each admission, including joint bridge effects.
4. Teach and audit the refined human BODY, physical contact and actual possession mechanisms on distinct exact senses. Use the existing SUBTLEX loader for spelling ordering, rotate spellings, and explicitly review rare senses/acronyms/proper names before calling a teacher. The proposal queue is not a sense-frequency estimate.
5. Route title-denotation, mental/physical alternatives, deprivation and attribution findings to their distinct source/scope/consumer remedies. A null answer preserves the bank's alternatives.
6. Retain the existing complete replay, semantic/runtime audit and sparse publication gates. Add the checkpoint's reproducible consumer cases to the existing runtime gate before claiming that later releases preserve this measured capability scope.

Significance prioritizes the independently warranted rule's marginal consequence and its bridge effects. Neither a high legacy co-occurrence count nor an unopposed open domain is confirmation. No exponential rate, bulk/tail knee, or joint entropy reduction is inferred from these screens.

